{#-
  OpenVDM lowering README template (Jinja2, https://jinja.palletsprojects.com/).

  The installer copies this file to server/etc/lowering_readme.md.j2 when
  that doesn't exist yet; edit the copy (or set loweringReadme.template in
  openvdm.yaml) to change the README. OpenVDM doesn't use this .dist file
  itself: without the copy, the README isn't written. The variables are
  described in build_lowering_readme_context() in server/lib/readme.py. The
  README is rebuilt whenever the lowering config is exported: Setup New
  Lowering, Finalize Lowering and Export Lowering Config, and by the Rebuild
  the Lowering README task.
-#}
# Lowering {{ lowering.loweringID }}{% if cruise.cruiseID %} (cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}){% endif %}


This directory holds the data collected during lowering {{ lowering.loweringID }}{% if cruise.cruiseID %} of cruise {{ cruise.cruiseID }}{% if cruise.cruiseName %} ({{ cruise.cruiseName }}){% endif %}{% endif %}{% if vessel.name %} aboard {{ vessel.name }}{% endif %}, organized by OpenVDM (Open Vessel Data Management).

## Lowering

{% if lowering.loweringStartDate or lowering.loweringEndDate %}
- **Dates:** {{ lowering.loweringStartDate or "?" }} to {{ lowering.loweringEndDate or "?" }}
{% endif %}
{% if lowering.loweringExtent %}
- **Extent:** {{ lowering.loweringExtent.westernmost }} to {{ lowering.loweringExtent.easternmost }} longitude, {{ lowering.loweringExtent.southernmost }} to {{ lowering.loweringExtent.northernmost }} latitude (decimal degrees)
{% endif %}
{% if vessel.name %}
- **Vessel:** {{ vessel.name }}
{% endif %}
{% if vessel.contact and (vessel.contact.institution or vessel.contact.email) %}
- **Contact:** {{ [vessel.contact.institution, vessel.contact.email] | select | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}

## Directory layout
Paths are relative to this directory.
{# A description is Markdown that goes under its folder's heading: a
   paragraph, a **Files:** list and an optional **Sub-directories:** list
   (#499). Each line ends in two spaces, a Markdown line break, so a single
   line break stays one, as on OpenVDM's pages (#460) #}

{% macro entry(d) %}
#### `{{ d.destDir }}{{ "" if d.file else "/" }}`: {{ d.longName or d.name }}
{% if d.description %}

{{ d.description | replace("\r\n", "\n") | replace("\n", "  \n") }}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
{% set entries = [
    {"destDir": files.readme, "longName": "this file", "file": true},
    {"destDir": files.lowering_config, "longName": "the lowering's OpenVDM configuration (JSON): the lowering details above and the directory layout", "file": true},
] + collection_systems + extra_directories %}
{% for d in entries | sort(attribute="destDir") %}
{{ entry(d) }}
{%- endfor %}

---

Generated by OpenVDM{% if openvdm_version %} {{ openvdm_version }}{% endif %} on {{ generated_on }}.
